## Typechecked Snippet {#twoslash-demo}

```ts twoslash
// @errors: 2322
interface SiteConfig {
  title: string;
  url: string;
  locales: string[];
}

const config: SiteConfig = {
  title: "Scientific Portal",
  url: "https://science.example.com",
  locales: 12345
};
```

